🛡️ Task 6: Research Report on the Importance of Patch Management

Part of the Oasis Infobyte Cybersecurity Internship (OIBSIP) — Task 6

📌 Objective

Research and write a report explaining the significance of patch management in cybersecurity — covering its role in system security, the consequences of neglecting patches, and best practices for building an effective patch management strategy.


The report covers:

What patch management is — the identify → assess → test → deploy → verify cycle
Why it matters — closing known vulnerabilities, reducing attack surface, compliance, and business trust
Real-world consequences of skipping patches — case studies including:
🔴 WannaCry Ransomware (2017)
🔴 Equifax Breach (2017)
🔴 Log4Shell (2021)
Best practices — asset inventory, prioritization frameworks, automation, staged testing, SLAs, and continuous monitoring

